Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.10,1:37:21.30,*Default,469,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(700,400)\fs16}往生乐土 太虚飘缈
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.94,1:37:30.71,*Default,470,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(700,378)\fad(700,400)\fs16}Where all the music that we always kept in side will fill the sky
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.94,1:37:30.71,*Default,470,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(700,400)\fs16}至爱天籁 弥亘天际
